{
  "plan": {
    "version": "0.1",
    "title": "偏导数的几何意义与截面切线",
    "goals": [
      "理解固定y=y₀截面在三维曲面上截出的二维曲线",
      "理解对x的偏导数等于固定截线上一元函数的导数",
      "明确截面位置y₀与切线斜率的区别与计算步骤",
      "掌握在给定点求对x偏导数并建立截线与切线几何图景的方法"
    ],
    "teaching_strategies": [
      "通过三维曲面截面动画建立固定变量的直观几何图景",
      "辨析截面平移与截线上求导的区别，消除常见误区",
      "结合二维切线与三维截面建立代数推导与几何斜率的对应"
    ],
    "numbers": [
      {
        "initial": 0,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 2,
        "label": "截面位置 y₀",
        "student_control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.01
        }
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "purpose": "建立固定y=y₀截面截出三维曲面的直观，明确偏导数的几何前提",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "note"
          },
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "visual",
            "capability": "function_surface_with_section"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "欢迎来到第二课。上一课我们观察了曲面整体，现在我们要研究同一高度上的点。求对 x 的偏导数时，关键在于固定输入 y 为常数 y₀。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "visual",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "content": {
                  "capability": "function_surface_with_section",
                  "parameters": {
                    "title": "曲面 z = x² + y² 与截面 y = y₀",
                    "expression": "x^2 + y^2",
                    "section_axis": "y"
                  },
                  "numbers": [
                    1
                  ]
                },
                "role": "main_visual",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "new_region"
                },
                "reusable_item": 2
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "偏导数∂f/∂x的几何研究步骤",
                  "items": [
                    "1. 固定输入 y = y₀，引入垂直截面",
                    "2. 观察截面截出的曲线 z = g(x)",
                    "3. 沿截线在指定点求一元函数导数"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "大家看，当固定 y 时，垂直截面 y = y₀ 切过旋转抛物面 z = x² + y²。在截面内部，允许 x 发生变化，z 随之改变，而 y 始终保持常数 y₀ 不变。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "观察截面与三维曲面相交形成的截线",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "辨析平移截面与求导的区别，并在特定截面上建立二维函数与切线",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          },
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "visual",
            "capability": "function_plot"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "我们在上一课研究了固定高度 z 的情况。而要求对 x 的偏导数，核心是在输入端固定 y 为某个常数 y₀。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "引导学习者关注截面位置y₀对三维曲面截线的影响",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "reusable",
                  "section": 1,
                  "item": 2
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "以曲面 z 等于 x 平方加 y 平方为例，当 y 被固定在 y₀ 时，截面垂直于 y 轴。在此截面上，y 保持不变，只有 x 可以自由变化，从而决定高度 z 的变化。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "z = f(x, y_0) = x^2 + y_0^2"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\left.\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\right|_{(1,1)} = \\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}(x^2+1^2)\\right|_{x=1} = 2"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "我现在把 y₀ 从 0 平移到 1。请注意，移动截面只是选择不同的研究曲线，平移本身并不是求导。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 1,
                "duration_intent": "normal",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "当固定 y 等于 1 时，截线对应一元函数 g(x) 等于 x 平方加 1。若取 x₀ 等于 1，则对应空间点 P 为 (1, 1, 2)。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "g(x) = x^2 + 1 \\implies g'(1) = 2 \\quad \\text{点 } P(1,1,2)"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "我们在二维平面上观察这条截线，此时纵轴表示高度 z。截线为 z 等于 x 平方加 1，在 x 等于 1 处的切线方程为 z 等于 2x，其斜率 2 正是对 x 的偏导数。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "visual",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "content": {
                  "capability": "function_plot",
                  "parameters": {
                    "title": "截面 y=1 内的截线与切线（纵轴为高度 z）",
                    "x_label": "x",
                    "y_label": "z",
                    "curve_labels": [
                      "截线 z=x²+1",
                      "P处切线 z=2x"
                    ],
                    "expressions": [
                      "((x)^(2))+(1)",
                      "(2)*(x)"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "role": "supporting_visual",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "right_of",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 4,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                },
                "reusable_item": 2
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "建立二维截线与切线的相切几何图景",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  },
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 5,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "local_board_item",
                  "moment": 5,
                  "item": 1
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "number_target",
            "prompt": "请试着将截面位置 y₀ 调整至 2，观察截线方程的变化。",
            "hints": [
              "拖动 y₀ 滑块至 2",
              "当 y₀=2 时，截线方程变为 z = x² + 4"
            ],
            "success_message": "很好！你成功将截面移动到了 y₀ = 2 位置。",
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "number_controls": [
              {
                "number": 1,
                "controls": [
                  "slider"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "value": 2,
            "tolerance": 0.005
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "严格推导偏导数数值与点斜式切线方程，总结一般方法与边界特征",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "承接之前的讨论，研究同一高度z是绘制二维等高线，而求对x的偏导数则是固定输入变量y等于y₀。在垂直截面内，y全程保持不变，允许x自由变化，高度z随之改变。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "明确固定y与截面截线的几何对应关系",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "对于截线函数，导数g′(x)=2x，在x=1处导数值为2。结合切点(1,2)，利用点斜式得到切线方程z-2=2(x-1)，即z=2x。这里的斜率是高度增量与x增量之比，而非屏幕上的角度。对于本例，偏导数f_x(x₀,y₀)=2x₀不依赖y₀，这是二次旋转抛物面的特殊性质；若换为f(x,y)=xy，其对x的偏导数就直接等于y。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "z - 2 = 2(x - 1) \\implies z = 2x"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "f_x(x_0, y_0) = \\left. \\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x} f(x, y_0) \\right|_{x = x_0}"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "总结偏导数核心概念，并通过思考题进行理解性自测与下一课铺垫",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "note"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "大家前面学习了截面与切线的关系。总结一下，当我们求对x的偏导数时，关键是将输入y固定为常数y0。此时沿着垂直于y轴的截面，曲面上只剩下x变化引起z变化的一元曲线。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "偏导数几何意义总结",
                  "items": [
                    "求∂z/∂x时：固定输入y = y₀（截面垂直于y轴）",
                    "截线实质：三维曲面在截面上的二维一元函数 z = f(x, y₀)",
                    "偏导数值：截线上点P处的切线斜率"
                  ]
                },
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 3,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "偏导数核心概念总结与课后思考",
                  "items": [
                    "1. ∂z/∂x 对应固定 y = y₀ 截面",
                    "2. ∂z/∂y 对应固定 x = x₀ 截面",
                    "3. 课后自测：验证当 x = 1, z = 2 时，y₀ = 1 的正确性",
                    "4. 下节预告：比较不同截面方向的导数与驻点判断"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "强调固定y=y0是求对x偏导数的基本几何前提",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "请思考这个理解检查题：在点P(1,1,2)处，如果改为求对y的偏导数，我们应该固定哪个变量？同理，若保持x=1固定，希望对应截线上的点高度z为2，y0应该设为多少呢？",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "z = x^2 + y^2 \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad 1^2 + y_0^2 = 2 \\quad (y_0 \\ge 0)"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "close": {
      "summary": "本课程深入讲解了偏导数的几何意义：通过固定一个变量（如y=y₀）得到截面曲线，将多元函数转化为截面上的局部一元函数，其切线的斜率即为偏导数。在下一课中，我们将进一步比较不同方向的变化率，寻找驻点与最值。",
      "focus": [
